{"id":"pareja","lemma":"pareja","pos":"noun","rank":874,"glosses":["couple, pair","partner (spouse)"],"ipa":"/paˈɾexa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"parejas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pareja.wav","examples":[{"text":"No somos una pareja.","en":"We're not a couple.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501382"},{"text":"Cada vez más parejas casadas comparten las tareas del hogar.","en":"More and more married couples share household chores.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34819"},{"text":"Somos la pareja perfecta.","en":"We are a perfect match.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459275"},{"text":"Los alumnos estudiaban en parejas.","en":"The students studied in pairs."},{"text":"Haríais una pareja encantadora.","en":"You'd make a lovely couple.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582022"}]}